<BaseLayout title="Parent portal" description="Parent portal information for SWEEP Schools. Secure sign-in is not enabled in this preview.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">For SWEEP families</span><h1>Parent portal</h1><p>A dedicated space for school-family communication is part of the proposed rebuild. The portal is not yet connected to an identity provider or school data system.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="portal-panel"><div class="portal-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌑</div><span class="eyebrow">Planned capability</span><h2>A secure family space, built carefully.</h2><p>This preview does not offer sign-in and does not collect passwords or learner information. Before the portal is implemented, SWEEP must confirm the required features, parent and staff roles, source of learner records, identity system, privacy requirements and support process.</p><p>Development and testing will use synthetic data only. Real learner information will not be connected until the school authorises the design and security controls.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact the school <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>